# The README's GIF. Regenerate: go build -o /tmp/renpet-bin/renpet . && PATH=/tmp/renpet-bin:$PATH vhs docs/demo.tape
Output docs/demo.gif
Set Shell zsh
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1060
Set Height 680
Set Padding 16
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Framerate 20

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show
Type "renpet --demo" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 3.5s
Up Sleep 700ms Up Sleep 1.2s
Type "2" Sleep 3.5s
Type "3" Sleep 1.5s Down Sleep 500ms Down Sleep 500ms Down Sleep 1.5s
Type "c" Sleep 2.5s
Type "n" Sleep 2s
Escape Sleep 500ms
Type "q" Sleep 500ms
Type "renpet now --short --demo" Sleep 400ms Enter
Sleep 2.5s
